# Project rules: Discord bot

- The bot token lives only in .env as DISCORD_TOKEN. Never paste it in code, logs, or chat. .env is in .gitignore.
- Use slash commands, one file per command in commands/. Re-run the deploy script when a command's name or options change.
- Request only the gateway intents the bot actually uses. Ask me before enabling privileged intents (Message Content, Server Members, Presence).
- Every command replies within 3 seconds, or calls deferReply() first for slow work.
- Catch errors in every command and reply with a short friendly message. Log the real error to the console.
- Add a cooldown to any command that calls an external API or costs money.
